  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Reform Support Project (HRSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDOs are revised to read as follows: (i) to improve access to and quality of priority national family health and reproductive health programs; and (ii) to develop the capacity of the Ministry of Public Health and Population (MOPHP) to manage, plan, and deliver basic health services and priority public health programs at the central level and in eight selected districts in the three targeted governorates.</narrative>
  </description>
